OL,3,GNEWSASearch for motorist after man dies
OL,4,Ain hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being hit by a car
OL,7,Fwhich was then driven away.
OL,9,FThe man in his 30s was hit on
OL,10,FSladefield Road in Alum Rock,
OL,11,FBirmingham, shortly after 00:15 GMT,
OL,12,Fpolice said.
OL,14,FOfficers were called to reports that a
OL,15,Fman had been hit and was seriously
OL,16,Finjured, said West Midlands Police, but
OL,17,Fhe died at the scene.
OL,19,FAn investigation is underway to to try
OL,20,Fand identify the car and driver
OL,21,Finvolved, and the force is appealing
OL,22,Ffor any witnesses to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
